+## Sales and variance
+
+- `POST /import/sales` takes `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`
+  and answers `{ "tickets": n, "dishes": n }` (`dishes` counts portions
+  sold). Tickets already imported are skipped. Any bad row or a run-out
+  imports nothing; the `bad_request` message names the row (`row 2` is the
+  first data row).
